{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30169","headline":"莺出谷 · 刘庄物","name":"莺出谷","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"幸因辞旧谷，从此及芳晨。\n欲语如调舌，初飞似畏人。\n风调归影便，日煖吐声频。\n翔集知无阻，联绵贵有因。\n喜迁乔木近，宁厌对花新。\n堪念微禽意，关关也爱春。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘庄物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30169.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30169","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}